    {
      "q": "What does State buy?",
      "a": "State primarily buys Security Guards and Patrol Services, Other Computer Related Services, and Computer Systems Design Services in FY2026 to date. Those categories account for $789M, $585M, and $523M respectively, with additional spending in administrative management, facilities support, and banking services."
